        "id": 1039306
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-08T16:40:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Theoretically, it should not contain a very large amount of commits, since it only grows in size when encountering merge commits. In very complex repositories, this queue can contain quite a few commits (The maxmimum size I saw when testing against the linux kernel was 1364). This is also only checked when encountering an UNINTERESTING commit in the Explore Phase.",
      "parentUuid": "ff57050a_1b7c62c7",
